{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1551862904,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MTc2OTIxNzk=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/3199","origin":"github"},"title":"Pointless warnings from download-url","message":"#### What is the problem?\n`download-url` spits out warnings about a missing cookie db, when there is none needed.\n\n#### What steps will reproduce the problem?\nRun the following in a fresh dataset with a sub dir `some`:\n```\n% datalad download-url https://github.com/datalad/example-dicom-functional/raw/master/events.tsv --path some/events.tsv --message \"Add events from github\"\n[INFO   ] Downloading 'https://github.com/datalad/example-dicom-functional/raw/master/events.tsv' into '/tmp/test-demo/some/events.tsv' \n[WARNING] Failed to open cookies DB /home/ben/.config/datalad/cookies: db type could not be determined [__init__.py:open:88] \n[WARNING] Failed to check for having a cookie for https://github.com/datalad/example-dicom-functional/raw/master/events.tsv: argument of type 'NoneType' is not iterable [cookies.py:__contains__:89] \n```\n\n#### What version of DataLad are you using (run `datalad --version`)? On what operating system (consider running `datalad wtf`)?\n\n0.12.0rc1","files":null}]}